network Model ⟦
    dense ⟬2⸴ 4⟭ ·
    relu ·
    dense ⟬4⸴ 1⟭ ·
⟧

process main⦅⦆ → int64 ⟦
    ethical_boundary auth ⟦
        rule authorized ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    ethical_boundary attacker ⟦
        rule malicious ↦ 1.0 ·
    ⟧

    vault v with auth ⟬ Model ⟭ threshold ↦ 3 ·
    seal v ·
    emit "Weights sealed" ·

    // Attacker tries to unseal with wrong boundary
    unseal v with attacker ·
    emit "Unreachable" ·

    yield 0 ·
⟧
